## GitHub API rate-limit behavior

Jenkins is configured with the GitHub API rate-limit checker mode `ThrottleOnOver`. When GitHub reports that an API rate limit has been exceeded, Jenkins throttles GitHub API activity. This can delay organization-folder scans and repository, branch, or pull-request discovery, which may in turn delay related jobs.

This setting is protective behavior; it does not itself send Slack notifications or provide per-app Grafana alerts.

## Scope to confirm

The Jenkins configuration shows the credentials and their configured consumers; it does not establish each GitHub App's full installation scope, permissions, or owner. Confirm those details with the app owners before treating this page as the authoritative inventory.